    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "指标口径",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Core 队列与 Worker 队列不可相加。** Core pending 包括已投递但尚未入库的结果；Worker outbox 是已识别但尚未收到 Core ACK 的结果。\n\n心跳约 20 秒更新、60 秒过期；旧 Worker 不上报队列时显示“暂无数据”。去重累计计数从本次指标部署起积累，随 SQLite 持久保存，不因音频淘汰或 Core 重启清零；首次有两次抓取后才有消费速率。面板时间范围内没有新结果时处理耗时/RTF 无数据。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "worker",
        "label": "Worker",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(orbit_audio_worker_info{job=\"orbit-core\"}, agent_id)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
